; The camcorder on its tripod: a fixed physical camera, never carried. Its Head (with the explicit LensMarker and EyeMarker and the box the player aims at) is built in code by
; ShedRecordingProps; the waiting shed's sequence turns it to the recording's first viewpoint (the lens at that viewpoint, its axis along that shot's) and offers the viewfinder through it.
